    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.poster.avif?t=1742891881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.webm?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.mp4?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.poster.avif?t=1742891881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.webm?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.mp4?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Let's super high jump through the screen!</strong><br><br>6180 the moon is a platformer game with a unique mechanic. It offers a fresh, unseen game play style by connecting the top and bottom of the screen. This allows in a mechanic with delightfully long jumps and no fear of &quot;slipping&quot; to death.<br><br>In addition to the unique gameplay, 6180 the moon delivers a unique storyline. The Sun has gone. The Moon sets off on a journey to find the Sun. Along the journey will be hazardous courses and deep realizations.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.poster.avif?t=1742891881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.webm?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/f03956c352d1e51e010424d9ec1fe9dd.mp4?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.poster.avif?t=1742891881\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.webm?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299660/extras/1bc32b6f1c7fadc6e9f6c2b49c9af941.mp4?t=1742891881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Let's super high jump through the screen!</strong><br><br>6180 the moon is a platformer game with a unique mechanic. It offers a fresh, unseen game play style by connecting the top and bottom of the screen. This allows in a mechanic with delightfully long jumps and no fear of &quot;slipping&quot; to death.<br><br>In addition to the unique gameplay, 6180 the moon delivers a unique storyline. The Sun has gone. The Moon sets off on a journey to find the Sun. Along the journey will be hazardous courses and deep realizations.",
